## AC result from its cases

| Cases of the AC | AC result |
|---|---|
| All `PASS` | `PASS` |
| Any `FAIL` | `FAIL` |
| No `FAIL`, some `BLOCKED` | `BLOCKED` |
| No `FAIL`/`BLOCKED`, some `NOT_RUN` | `NOT_RUN` |

## Feature verdict

1. Any AC `FAIL`, or an open BLOCKER/HIGH defect → `{{changes_word}}`
2. Else any AC `BLOCKED`/`NOT_RUN`, or a P1 case not `PASS` → `{{blocked_word}}` (name the missing evidence)
3. Else → `{{accepted_word}}`

## Counting

- Show `p PASS · f FAIL · b BLOCKED · n NOT_RUN (of total)`; percentages only with their denominator.
- Stubbed results count as `PASS` for the application's handling only; list the stub under Limitations.
- Deviations from the plan are listed; expected results are never rewritten.

